12.   (Currently Amended) A method of controlling an environment control system comprising:

Apportioning apportioning with a pack management system, an amount of air to be distributed by the system between one or more of two or more available air conditioning packs based on the total amount of air to be distributed and the operating efficiencies of the packs;

